@startuml
title Verification Numero Telephone (OTP Firebase)

actor User
participant "Page /verify-phone" as UI
participant "Hook usePhoneVerification" as Hook
participant "Service PhoneVerification" as Service
participant "Firebase Auth\n(OTP + reCAPTCHA)" as FirebaseAuth
participant "Firestore Users" as Firestore
participant "NextAuth Session" as Session

User -> UI : Ouvre /verify-phone
UI -> Hook : init(uid)
Hook -> Service : checkVerificationStatus(uid)
Service -> Firestore : findById(uid)
Firestore --> Service : user(phone, phoneNumberVerified)
Service --> Hook : status(initialStep)
Hook --> UI : step=phone|already-verified

User -> UI : Saisit numero + demande OTP
UI -> Hook : sendOtp()
Hook -> Service : buildAndValidatePhone(...)
Service --> Hook : fullPhone
Hook -> FirebaseAuth : signInWithPhoneNumber(fullPhone, recaptcha)
FirebaseAuth --> Hook : confirmationResult
Hook --> UI : step=otp

User -> UI : Saisit code OTP
UI -> Hook : verifyOtp(code)
Hook -> FirebaseAuth : confirmationResult.confirm(code)
FirebaseAuth --> Hook : success
Hook -> Service : persistVerifiedPhone(uid, fullPhone)
Service -> Firestore : update(phoneNumbers, phoneNumberVerified=true)
Firestore --> Service : updated user
Service --> Hook : success + isPhoneChanged
Hook -> Session : update(session.user)
Hook --> UI : step=success
UI --> User : Numero verifie

note over UI,Firestore
Si le numero est modifie dans /profil/informations:
phoneNumberVerified est repasse a false
et un avertissement est affiche avant sauvegarde.
end note

@enduml
